  "details": "If I'm in an instance with an ongoing linked event, I cannot report the event from the Quick Menu report menu; there is no UI button for it in Quick Menu. Every other moderation report type is supported from the Quick Menu report menu, only notably the event type is missing.\n\nThe current workaround is to navigate to the event announcement from notifications or from the group page, which is far more burdensome to find.\n\nConsider adding \"Event\" to the Quick Menu report UI.",
